@startuml
title Orchestrator - Component Boundaries
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Developer
actor "Platform Engineer" as Platform
actor "Organization Administrator" as OrgAdmin
actor "CI/CD Client" as CICD

component "React + TypeScript\nWeb Console" as WebConsole
component "HTTP/API Delivery" as API
component "Authentication Service\nUC-00" as Authentication
component "Administration Services\nUC-01..UC-04" as Admin
component "Preview/Deployment Services\nUC-05..UC-07, UC-09" as Deploy
component "Planning Core" as Planner
component "Resource Provisioning\nUC-08" as Provisioning
component "Workload Runtime" as Workload
component "Persistence Adapters" as Persistence
database PostgreSQL as DB
component "Terraform Executor" as Terraform
component "Existing Cluster Adapter" as Existing
component "Secret Store Adapter" as Secrets
cloud AWS
node "Kubernetes / kind / EKS" as Kubernetes

Developer --> WebConsole
Platform --> WebConsole
OrgAdmin --> WebConsole
WebConsole --> API : same origin /api/v1
CICD --> API
API --> Authentication
API --> Admin
Authentication --> Persistence
API --> Deploy
Admin --> Persistence
Admin --> Secrets
Deploy --> Planner
Deploy --> Provisioning
Deploy --> Workload
Deploy --> Persistence
Planner --> Persistence : read snapshots/catalog/state
Provisioning --> Persistence
Provisioning --> Terraform
Provisioning --> Existing
Workload --> Kubernetes
Terraform --> AWS
Terraform --> Kubernetes : v2 namespace / Redis / PostgreSQL
Existing --> Kubernetes : verify/resolve target
Persistence --> DB
component "Definition-selected rendering" as Rendering
component "Native renderer" as Native
component "score-k8s adapter" as ScoreAdapter
artifact "Pinned score-k8s CLI" as ScoreCLI
Deploy --> Rendering : preflight; resolved bindings + selection
Rendering --> Native : shared platform policy helpers only in v2
Rendering --> ScoreAdapter : required v2 immutable bundle, both profiles
ScoreAdapter --> ScoreCLI : private workspace; output-only provisioner
Rendering --> Workload : validated manifests
note right of ScoreAdapter
No database/namespace provisioning.
Only Secret references enter CLI workspace.
end note
component "Environment Settings / Transition Services" as Transitions
component "Scoped Secret Store Resolver" as StoreResolver
component "PostgreSQL Backup / Restore Adapter" as Transfer
cloud "Selected Vault KV v2 stores" as VaultStores
API --> Transitions
Transitions --> Persistence : atomic operation admission/stages
Transitions --> Transfer : quiesce, backup, restore, verify
Transfer --> Kubernetes : explicit retained/new targets
Transitions --> Deploy : pinned generation, full rollout
Transitions --> StoreResolver : copy / verify before commit
StoreResolver --> Secrets : platform credentials only
StoreResolver --> VaultStores : immutable values/bundles
Workload --> VaultStores : VSO scoped auth/read
component "Verified Module Registry / Source Policy" as ModuleRegistry
component "Internal HTTP State Backend / Locks" as StateBackend
component "State Encryption / Scoped Capability" as StateSecurity
component "Resource Cleanup Service" as Cleanup
Admin --> ModuleRegistry : allowlisted source / immutable inspect
Planner --> ModuleRegistry : read metadata only
Provisioning --> ModuleRegistry : verify pinned content
Terraform --> StateBackend : LOCK/GET/POST/UNLOCK
StateBackend --> StateSecurity : private auth / encrypt / owner-fence
StateBackend --> DB : encrypted state, atomic locks
Cleanup --> Persistence : write-ahead ownership / progress
Cleanup --> Terraform : separate DESTROY reverse graph
API --> Cleanup : PE/Admin confirmed user deletion / narrow test capability
note right of StateBackend
PostgreSQL stores restricted ciphertext.
Console never receives state or capability.
D12-D14 full recovery/reconcile/backup deferred.
end note
@enduml
